# Q Light Controller Plus - tileable pleated stage curtain
# Heavy velour. Fixture light is applied as plain diffuse Lambert, so the diffuse
# colour alone decides how much of a beam the curtain gives back. It is set high
# enough that a beam carries the fabric into the compressive part of the tone
# mapping, where the falloff spreads and softens rather than tracking the folds.
# The specular is only reached by the ambient pass, and is deliberately broad -
# a low exponent - so that it reads as light sitting in the nap of a thick cloth
# rather than as a highlight on its surface. The softness of the shading across a
# fold comes from the mesh, whose normals are much flatter than its geometry.
newmtl curtain
Ka 0.000000 0.000000 0.000000
Kd 0.420000 0.390000 0.390000
Ks 0.250000 0.240000 0.240000
Ns 6.000000
d 1.000000
illum 2
